message: "If you use these certificates or checkers, please cite them. Concept DOI (all versions): 10.5281/zenodo.24191316; v0.1.0: 10.5281/zenodo.24191317. These are computer-assisted, not a formal proof: the arithmetic is re-checked in Lean, the reasoning connecting it to the packing statements is not formalized."
